#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:5
#: 8faecfe51c7c43429dfcca2b01f226ff
msgid "QuadPlane VTOL Tuning Overview"
msgstr "四旋翼飞机 VTOL 调参概述"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:7
#: 5589c893b61d403da906eae6f39eb4de
msgid ""
"This section provides an overview of how to tune various QuadPlane VTOL "
"parameters."
msgstr "本节概述了如何调整各种四旋翼飞机 VTOL 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:9
#: ed14ded6fb7f453b95f9eea27c0caf1f
msgid ""
"For normal Quadplanes follow :ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-process` for "
"detailed tuning steps"
msgstr "对于普通四旋翼飞机，请遵循 :ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-process` 进行详细调参步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:10
#: c9a7b2993cbe49459fbd5254a1b38e4b
msgid "For Tailsitters, see :ref:`tailsitter-tuning-guide`"
msgstr "对于尾坐式，请参阅 :ref:`tailsitter-tuning-guide`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:11
#: 5d4fda2eb0244b07aec37b38333d8ece
msgid ""
"For non-tailsitter Quadplanes with tilt rotors for vectored YAW, see "
":ref:`tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning` in addition to :ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-"
"process`"
msgstr ""
"对于使用倾转旋翼实现矢量偏航的非尾坐式四旋翼飞机，请除 :ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-process` 外，还参阅 "
":ref:`tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:14
#: 409f5fbf44bb4192b9ddb79a0faea463
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:16
#: 291b1dba52a542d38f0405afe752526c
msgid ""
"The default parameters controlling the VTOL motors PID loops should allow "
"most frames to initially hover controllably, if the motors' mechanics are "
"setup and aligned correctly and escs calibrated."
msgstr "控制 VTOL 电机 PID 回路的默认参数应允许大多数机架在电机机械设置和对齐正确以及 ESC 校准完成的情况下，能够初始受控悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:18
#: 67678119e3844eba9f76fe742f2476d8
msgid ""
"The most important parameters controlling stability are the Roll/Pitch/Yaw "
"PIDS. For altitude control, the vertical position controller's parameters "
"and Motor Thrust Scaling parameters, and for navigation/loiter the Loiter "
"controllers's parameters"
msgstr ""
"控制稳定性最重要的参数是横滚/俯仰/偏航 PID。对于高度控制，是垂直位置控制器的参数和电机推力缩放参数；对于导航/Loiter，是 Loiter "
"控制器的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:20
#: a210372e98e045c08bebc09f269f6ce1
msgid ""
"Normally, it's best to start by tuning the Rate Roll/Pitch P in QSTABILIZE "
"mode then move onto tuning altitude hold in QHOVER mode, then QLOITER (which"
" often needs no tuning) and finally the waypoint navigation performance in "
"Auto mode."
msgstr ""
"通常，最好从在 QSTABILIZE 模式中调整速率横滚/俯仰 P 开始，然后在 QHOVER 模式中调整高度保持，再到 "
"QLOITER（通常不需要调参），最后在 Auto 模式中调整航点导航性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:25
#: c6dd688b03964c73896818eac02a2d41
msgid ""
"for Tailsitter QuadPlanes, some axes need a slightly different PID tuning "
"approach depending on the exact frame configuration used. Be sure to also "
"read :ref:`TailSitter Tuning <tailsitter-tuning-guide>`."
msgstr ""
"对于尾坐式四旋翼飞机，某些轴需要略微不同的 PID 调参方法，具体取决于使用的机架配置。请务必阅读 :ref:`尾坐式调参 <tailsitter-"
"tuning-guide>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:28
#: d211e3cebe4a44f5a6789e97b662d055
msgid "Filter tuning"
msgstr "滤波器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:30
#: f0ba332e6e6247e39c749f55aa95b0a3
msgid ""
"QuadPlanes are often affected by vibration and tuning the various software "
"filters available is critical to achieving an optimum overall tune. A guide "
"on tuning the various notch filters available can be found on the "
":ref:`Notch Filtering wiki page <common-imu-notch-filtering>`. A optimum "
"tune will be obtained on the D terms, below, if the filtering has been "
"optimized first. However, in many circumstances reasonable performance can "
"be obtained with just PID tuning the P terms."
msgstr ""
"四旋翼飞机通常受震动影响，调整各种可用软件滤波器对于实现最优整体调参结果至关重要。有关调整各种可用陷波滤波器的指南可在 :ref:`陷波滤波器 Wiki"
" 页面 <common-imu-notch-filtering>` 上找到。如果先优化滤波，则在以下 D 项上会获得最优调参结果。但在许多情况下，仅通过"
" PID 调参 P 项就可以获得合理的性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:34
#: 693cfb4f8744489898ceded5f10c5bc8
msgid "Roll/Pitch tuning"
msgstr "横滚/俯仰调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:36
#: 4392142276404d38bd309bb88b401e5c
msgid ""
"The ``Q_A_RAT_RLL_x`` and ``Q_A_RAT_PIT_x`` Roll/Pitch Rate parameters which"
" convert the desired rotation rate into a motor output are the most "
"important. If not a tailsitter, then the ``Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF`` will be zero and"
" corrections are dominated by P/I/D. In tailsitters, then the FF terms "
"dominate (Pitch axis only) and P/D are primarily for disturbance correction."
" For tuning tailsitter pitch axis, see :ref:`pitch-yaw-tuning`."
msgstr ""
"``Q_A_RAT_RLL_x`` 和 ``Q_A_RAT_PIT_x`` "
"横滚/俯仰速率参数将所需转速转换为电机输出，是最重要的参数。如果不是尾坐式，则 ``Q_A_RAT_PIT_FF`` 将为零，修正主要由 P/I/D "
"主导。在尾坐式中，FF 项（仅俯仰轴）主导，P/D 主要用于扰动修正。有关尾坐式俯仰轴调参，请参阅 :ref:`pitch-yaw-tuning`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:38
#: 2714b1012f7c42f1a542cae72a2572c0
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_A_ANG_RLL_P<Q_A_ANG_RLL_P>` and "
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_PIT_P<Q_A_ANG_PIT_P>` Roll/Pitch P converts the desired angle "
"into a desired rotation rate which is then fed to the Rate controller."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_RLL_P<Q_A_ANG_RLL_P>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_ANG_PIT_P<Q_A_ANG_PIT_P>` "
"横滚/俯仰 P 将所需角度转换为所需转速，然后输入速率控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:40
#: 4033e219db2449598b61296d7508099d
msgid ""
"A higher value will make the QuadPlane more responsive to roll/pitch inputs,"
" a lower value will make it smoother"
msgstr "较高的值将使四旋翼飞机对横滚/俯仰输入响应更灵敏，较低的值将使其更平滑"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:42
#: b62361bd882b4b66a461720296f2c675
msgid ""
"If set too high, the QuadPlane will oscillate on the roll and/or pitch axis"
msgstr "如果设置过高，四旋翼飞机将在横滚和/或俯仰轴上振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:44
#: 9ebae13dc085468ab59b1d89f49e5f43
msgid "If set too low the QuadPlane will become sluggish to inputs"
msgstr "如果设置过低，四旋翼飞机对输入的响应将变得迟钝"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:46
#: e664744c0d3e4588817f2b143acb46b0
msgid ""
"An objective view of the overall Roll and Pitch performance can be seen by "
"graphing the :ref:`dataflash log's <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-"
"logs-in-mission-planner>` ATT message's DesRoll vs Roll and DesPit vs Pitch."
" The \"Roll\" (i.e. actual roll) should closely follow the \"DesRoll\" while"
" in stabilized modes. Pitch should similarly closely follow DesPit."
msgstr ""
"可以通过绘制 :ref:`数据闪存日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` ATT 消息的 DesRoll 与 Roll 和 DesPit 与 Pitch "
"的对比图来客观查看整体横滚和俯仰性能。在稳定模式下，「Roll」（即实际横滚）应紧密跟随「DesRoll」。俯仰也应类似地紧密跟随 DesPit。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:50
#: 79b5cf3ac32541e581399ac50bcb53b4
msgid ""
"Alternatively you may wish to try automatically tuning the rate parameters "
"using the :ref:`QUICKTUNE <quicktune>`."
msgstr "或者，您可以尝试使用 :ref:`QUICKTUNE <quicktune>` 自动调整速率参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:53
#: 1a27890740e949e2a64b48ca1deaca1d
msgid "Yaw Tuning"
msgstr "偏航调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:55
#: 08ffe877b719470db8fbafc26d51e8fa
msgid ""
"The Angle Yaw and Rate Yaw parameters control the yaw response. With "
"QuadPlanes, these often need tuning to get the desired YAW response, since "
"configurations vary widely. In non-tailsitters, then the ``Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF`` "
"will be zero and corrections are dominated by P/I/D. But in tailsitters, the"
" FF term dominates and P/D are primarily for disturbance correction. For "
"tuning a tailsitter yaw axis, see :ref:`pitch-yaw-tuning`."
msgstr ""
"角度偏航和速率偏航参数控制偏航响应。对于四旋翼飞机，这些通常需要调参以获得所需的偏航响应，因为配置差异很大。在非尾坐式中，``Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF``"
" 将为零，修正主要由 P/I/D 主导。但在尾坐式中，FF 项主导，P/D 主要用于扰动修正。有关尾坐式偏航轴调参，请参阅 :ref:`pitch-"
"yaw-tuning`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:57
#: 32e602df01f1425e94aceae9bb78ac8b
msgid ""
"Similar to roll and pitch, if either :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P<Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` or "
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_YAW_P<Q_A_ANG_YAW_P>` is too high the QuadPlane's heading will"
" oscillate. If they are too low, the QuadPlane may be unable to maintain its"
" heading."
msgstr ""
"类似于横滚和俯仰，如果 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P<Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` 或 "
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_YAW_P<Q_A_ANG_YAW_P>` 过高，四旋翼飞机的航向将振荡。如果过低，四旋翼飞机可能无法保持其航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:59
#: cfe3b197446c44d5aeac21b179f0c363
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_A_ANG_YAW_P<Q_A_ANG_YAW_P>` is the gain on the error between the"
" autopilots desired heading and actual heading which is fed into the Rate "
"controller to demand a rotation rate. The "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P<Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` is the gain applied to the difference "
"between demanded rotation rate and actual."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_A_ANG_YAW_P<Q_A_ANG_YAW_P>` "
"是飞控所需航向与实际航向之间误差的增益，该误差输入到速率控制器以产生转速需求。:ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P<Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` "
"是应用于所需转速与实际转速之间差值的增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:61
#: 52b880f0ac3545a19ce0685b399e4f6f
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_YAW_RATE_MAX<Q_YAW_RATE_MAX>` parameter controls how quickly "
"QuadPlane rotates based on a pilot’s yaw input in stabilized modes."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_YAW_RATE_MAX<Q_YAW_RATE_MAX>` 参数控制在稳定模式下四旋翼飞机根据飞手偏航输入旋转的速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:64
#: 9547d5af7e1b41a497d6f87e1b70c793
msgid "Altitude Tuning"
msgstr "高度调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:66
#: 00db20335ce14cbcac2938ec84de5c1a
msgid ""
"The QHOVER (altitude hold) related tuning parameters are related to the "
"vertical position controller and the motor thrust scaling, which linearizes "
"the throttle to motor thrust response to improve the position controllers "
"response."
msgstr "QHOVER（高度保持）相关调参参数与垂直位置控制器和电机推力缩放有关，后者线性化了油门到电机推力的响应，以改善位置控制器的响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:68
#: 3066a1d802184ec0a8a64683a27c1e56
msgid ""
"The ``Q_P_POSZ_P`` parameter is used to convert the altitude error (the "
"difference between the desired altitude and the actual altitude) to a "
"desired climb or descent rate. A higher rate will make it more aggressively "
"attempt to maintain it’s altitude but if set too high leads to a jerky "
"throttle response."
msgstr ""
"``Q_P_POSZ_P`` "
"参数用于将高度误差（期望高度与实际高度之差）转换为期望爬升或下降速率。该速率越高，飞行器会越积极地尝试维持高度，但设置过高会导致油门响应抖动。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:70
#: d38ed1bd81aa421da2bb32dd71ec0c87
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_P_D_VEL_P<Q_P_D_VEL_P>` (which normally requires no tuning) "
"converts the desired climb or descent rate into a desired acceleration up or"
" down."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_P_D_VEL_P<Q_P_D_VEL_P>` （通常无需调参）将期望爬升或下降速率转换为期望的向上或向下加速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:72
#: b60e32ba022b49339833e261141d65d0
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_P<Q_P_D_ACC_P>`, :ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_I<Q_P_D_ACC_I>`, and "
":ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_D<Q_P_D_ACC_D>` PID gains convert the acceleration error "
"(i.e the difference between the desired acceleration and the actual "
"acceleration) into a motor output. The 1:2 ratio of P to I (i.e. I is twice "
"the size of P) should be maintained if you modify these parameters. These "
"values should never be increased but for very powerful QuadPlane VTOL motors"
" you may get better response by reducing both by 50% (i.e P to 0.5, I to "
"1.0)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_P<Q_P_D_ACC_P>`、:ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_I<Q_P_D_ACC_I>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_P_D_ACC_D<Q_P_D_ACC_D>` PID "
"增益将加速度误差（即期望加速度与实际加速度之差）转换为电机输出。如果修改这些参数，应保持 P 与 I 的 1:2 比例（即 I 是 P "
"的两倍）。这些值绝不应增大，但对于动力非常强劲的 QuadPlane VTOL 电机，将两者都减小 50%（即 P 减为 0.5，I 减为 "
"1.0）可能会获得更好的响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:75
#: 228c3456be974c909599bbd31716752c
msgid "Loiter Tuning"
msgstr "Loiter 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:77
#: afb2e77127514a0a873565a2afabfc2d
msgid ""
"Generally if Roll and Pitch are tuned correctly,  the :ref:`GPS <common-"
"diagnosing-problems-using-logs_gps_glitches>` and :ref:`compass <common-"
"diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>` are set-up and "
"performing well and :ref:`vibration levels <common-diagnosing-problems-"
"using-logs_vibrations>` are acceptable, Loiter does not require much tuning "
"but please see the :ref:`Loiter Mode <qloiter-mode>` page for more details "
"on tunable parameters including the horizontal speed."
msgstr ""
"通常，如果横滚和俯仰调参正确，:ref:`GPS <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_gps_glitches>` 和 :ref:`罗盘 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_compass_interference>` 设置良好且性能良好，:ref:`震动水平 <common-diagnosing-"
"problems-using-logs_vibrations>` 可以接受，Loiter 不需要太多调参，但请参阅 :ref:`Loiter 模式 "
"<qloiter-mode>` 页面了解包括水平速度在内的可调参数的更多详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:86
#: f9cc1981c08f428480aea519b33d0d95
msgid "In-flight Tuning"
msgstr "飞行中调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:88
#: 8cf068d2ee29465a8a4d04d150e922dc
msgid ""
"Many parameters can be tuned while in flight, see :ref:`common-transmitter-"
"tuning`"
msgstr "许多参数可以在飞行中调整，参见 :ref:`common-transmitter-tuning`"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:92
#: cffb20f01a094608a5c8f304b7325b29
msgid "Video introduction to PIDs"
msgstr "PID 视频介绍"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:94
#: 7cdff375a1ce4be2a29e988021f7b69a
msgid ""
"PIDs (Proportional - Integral - Derivative) are the method used by our "
"firmware to continuously stabilize the vehicle"
msgstr "PID（比例-积分-微分）是我们的固件用于持续稳定飞行器的方法"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:97
#: c5b4b506f89d4ee69463c326e1264d3f
msgid ""
"Proportional = Immediate Correction: The further off you are the bigger the "
"correction you make."
msgstr "比例 = 即时校正：偏差越大，校正量越大。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:99
#: 740ad83c7cc04149a3c3a27846039502
msgid ""
"Integral = Over time or steady state correction: If we are failing to make "
"progress add additional correction."
msgstr "积分 = 随时间或稳态校正：如果未能取得进展，则增加额外校正。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-vtol-tuning.rst:101
#: af0b47741c924eb6ad9956e68c292524
msgid ""
"Derivative = Take it Easy correction: Is the correction going to fast? if it"
" is slow it down (dampen) it a bit to avoid overshoot."
msgstr "微分 = 缓和校正：校正速度太快了吗？如果是，则稍微减慢（阻尼）以避免过冲。"
